"lc0593-2", "slug": "lc0593-2", "uri": "https://api.sketchfab.com/v3/tags/lc0593-2"}], "categories": [{"name": "furniture-home"}], "thumbnails": {"images": [{"uid": "452bc48f262d40f5beaf9aba545de2eb", "size": 101586, "width": 1920, "url": "https://media.sketchfab.com/models/3bdf2065c1f64cbbb508e59da94dfc97/thumbnails/efbf9186b6834d648d999c7a0ae34437/97d33f0c84b54dd48624346c99e9bbef.jpeg", "height": 1080}, {"uid": "8cf50901b61c4deabc07ecdb827a1fdc", "size": 31508, "width": 1024, "url": "https://media.sketchfab.com/models/3bdf2065c1f64cbbb508e59da94dfc97/thumbnails/efbf9186b6834d648d999c7a0ae34437/c4a4f5e034cd40e684d4651a2aa119d5.jpeg", "height": 576}, {"uid": "4e9fb7972aa944a998332db478a3193c", "size": 16893, "width": 720, "url": "https://media.sketchfab.com/models/3bdf2065c1f64cbbb508e59da94dfc97/thumbnails/efbf9186b6834d648d999c7a0ae34437/a0698366fba84d8e8033bf6a95eb5d31.jpeg", "height": 405}, {"uid": "43c2d1df629c4be6aa159fb34d76548e", "size": 3045, "width": 256, "url": "https://media.sketchfab.com/models/3bdf2065c1f64cbbb508e59da94dfc97/thumbnails/efbf9186b6834d648d999c7a0ae34437/8de486d599e34e75833aa5cec5c5680e.jpeg", "height": 144}, {"uid": "68b5e983e81c48eb92ccdf7287af283e", "size": 967, "width": 64, "url": "https://media.sketchfab.com/models/3bdf2065c1f64cbbb508e59da94dfc97/thumbnails/efbf9186b6834d648d999c7a0ae34437/4de6a93873084a15b61df08e07517eec.jpeg", "height": 36}]}, "user": {"uid": "0598bba697074cc98d7de94cd137cc01", "username": "vargov", "displayName": "Vargov\u00aeDesign", "profileUrl": "https://sketchfab.com/vargov", "account": "basic", "avatar": {"uri": "https://api.sketchfab.com/v3/avatars/694e93fd792a4ae1b23e94a52c5001f9", "images": [{"size": 625, "width": 32, "url": "https://media.sketchfab.com/avatars/694e93fd792a4ae1b23e94a52c5001f9/74432462c2e7482fa8705c9d19942fc9.png", "height": 32}, {"size": 916, "width": 48, "url": "https://media.sketchfab.com/avatars/694e93fd792a4ae1b23e94a52c5001f9/c822a82c4bad414194bd11b40f3c089d.png", "height": 48}, {"size": 1677, "width": 90, "url": "https://media.sketchfab.com/avatars/694e93fd792a4ae1b23e94a52c5001f9/f77e222a59574b71ac92c34b1691b902.png", "height": 90}, {"size": 1818, "width": 100, "url": "https://media.sketchfab.com/avatars/694e93fd792a4ae1b23e94a52c5001f9/2826eadef4944b58aab99abe788dce73.png", "height": 100}]}, "uri": "https://api.sketchfab.com/v3/users/0598bba697074cc98d7de94cd137cc01"}, "description": "Floor lamp. Vargov(R)Design, article LC0593-2.\n\nThe same bouquet, gathered more quietly. The umbrellas stand closer together and almost at one level \u2014 not a scattered inflorescence but a dense head from which the light comes out in a single broad pool. The change in spacing between the discs changes the whole character of the piece: there it was a garden, here it is one flower. The stems rise from the base in a strict bunch, and the vertical reads cleaner than in the loose version. By day it is graphic work in pleated discs on golden stems: the relief is read through light and shade, the silhouette is compact and spare. In the evening light from the cores runs out along the folds and gathers into one shared glow \u2014 the lamp gives not a scatter of haloes but an even warm circle beside the armchair.\nWhere it works\n\nMade to order in any size and colour.\nProduct page: https://vargov.ru/en/catalog/lc0593-2\nBuild your own composition: https://configurator.vargov.ru\nAll models: https://vargov.ru", "faceCount": 79686, "createdAt": "2026-09-09T21:38:51.119617", "vertexCount": 37060, "isAgeRestricted": false, "archives": {"glb": {"textureCount": 0, "size": 6871460, "type": "glb", "textureMaxResolution": 0, "faceCount": 79686, "vertexCount": 184594}, "gltf": {"textureCount": 0, "size": 2117991, "type": "gltf", "textureMaxResolution": 0, "faceCount": 79686, "vertexCount": 184594}, "source": {"textureCount": null, "size": 2911548, "type": "source", "textureMaxResolution": null, "faceCount": null, "vertexCount": null}, "usdz": {"textureCount": null, "size"